# Local Studio functions

When the user wants the frontend to use **local** Supabase functions:

1. Ensure Docker Desktop is running.
2. Terminal A: `./serve-functions.sh` (from repo root)
3. Terminal B: `cd frontend && pnpm run dev:local-fn`

This keeps Auth/DB on live project `xmxsqmxuiksldqhtugvv` and only runs function code locally.

To go back to live functions: `cd frontend && pnpm run dev` (no `dev:local-fn`).

Do not change `frontend/app/studio/supabase.ts` client URL for this mode — the Vite proxy (`STUDIO_FUNCTIONS_TARGET=local`) is the switch.
